STeve Lefevre wrote:
>
> Is there any benefit to having 2 BOHs, other than organizational (i.e. 
> having two bags for different classes of stuff)?
>
> I mean, can you carry more loot with two bags, if you're already 
> stressed out with one full bag?

No.  For weight it makes no difference if it is in one or many
bags.  Exception - If you are subject to random curses having
several means your total weight doesn't go up as much if one
goes from blessed to (un)cursed vs your only one.

> Also there is the danger of accidentally putting one bag inside of the 
> other.

There IS an advantage to carrying a bag of holding and a sack
for reasons related to this.  Items that cause s bag of holding
to explode do not cause a regular sack to explode.  Put your
nondangerous items in the (oH and your dangerous ones in the
sack.  Hmmm, I think that's also true of an oilskin bag so if
you can find an oilskin bag it beats a regular sack.

